with g as (insert into public.galleries (slug,name,hero,intro,sort,published) values ('rallypraguerevival','Rally Prague Revival','/assets/img/491946_a2dcee4e911249b0802d95e5e60a12d0.jpg','This weekend, I headed to <span><span class="green">Rallye Prague Revival</span></span> with my colleague Matěj, who’s also a photographer, and I was really excited to see what the event had in store for us. <span><span class="green">Amazing atmosphere</span></span>, classic cars with <span><span class="green">real character</span></span>, the smell of fuel, dust, puddles, mud… everything you’d expect and more. The whole event had such an <span class="green"><span>incredible vibe</span></span> and offered plenty of moments worth capturing. A perfect way to wrap up the weekend – full of adrenaline, photos, and <span class="green"><span>inspiration</span></span>.',6,true) returning id)
